[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Version=1.0
Name=Better Awake Tray
Name[zh_TW]=保持清醒工具列圖示
Comment=Shows whether the machine is being kept awake and starts or ends a session from the system tray
Comment[zh_TW]=在系統匣顯示電腦是否正在保持清醒，並可從這裡開始或結束一次保持清醒
Exec=awake-tray
Icon=better-awake
Terminal=false
StartupNotify=false
# Autostart only. The tray is an indicator for the service, not an application
# a user launches, so it stays out of the application menu.
NoDisplay=true
X-GNOME-Autostart-enabled=true
